{"id": "official:sentence:f29cf872-8d07-4145-a2f9-be31318263a0", "text": "我在黄山最高峰叫了你的名字，可惜你没听见。", "shortMeaning": "我在黄山最高峰喊你的名字，可惜你没听见。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b6cf696a-9c87-4c79-96e8-a5f17b9d4eeb", "text": "我坐在我妹妹的旁边吃饭。", "shortMeaning": "我坐在妹妹旁边吃饭。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7ad52c6e-ccb5-464e-bc14-97a35ce49ba4", "text": "我坐过站了，怎么办？", "shortMeaning": "我坐过站了，该怎么办？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:97a440db-cfa4-4409-a46c-bec03a952c11", "text": "我坚信他在商业界会有所作为。", "shortMeaning": "我坚信他在商界会有所作为。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7a5e797e-0eaa-4d40-87b9-773114d13ebf", "text": "我坚持认为我的观点是对的。", "shortMeaning": "我坚持认为自己的观点是对的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2b44bdfa-09db-41c4-b23a-a666aa630346", "text": "我处理这事有困难。", "shortMeaning": "这事我处理起来有困难。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2d396941-876a-48a7-b07a-0ce4235c1056", "text": "我多想待在家里睡一整天啊。", "shortMeaning": "我多想在家睡上一整天啊。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9218ac57-7774-4b20-a963-b6af51003d9a", "text": "我大吃了一顿比萨。", "shortMeaning": "我大吃了一顿披萨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0c59f4fb-b1d0-44ab-9784-f2d804aa3348", "text": "我大学里的第一天相当没意思。", "shortMeaning": "我上大学的第一天挺没意思。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:db05a5fb-88f1-4169-82fb-3bcd13adb8f7", "text": "我大概五点到这里。", "shortMeaning": "我大约五点到达这里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1a50b7f1-e9ee-45c9-9811-3f8ffa676879", "text": "我大部分能听懂他们说的话，但是听不懂他们说的俗语。", "shortMeaning": "他们的话我大多听得懂，但听不懂俗语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:caf76cb5-8512-4386-a457-eb3d9882fcd8", "text": "我天天在这里做买卖，不会让你吃亏的！", "shortMeaning": "我天天在这儿做买卖，不会让你吃亏！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:59054d81-5be0-4f88-9d3a-c9837d4446e1", "text": "我天黑之前到达了村庄。", "shortMeaning": "我在天黑前到达村庄。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bf46f6a8-6417-43f4-bbf5-4e1c2ff81528", "text": "我天黑后不喜欢出门。", "shortMeaning": "我天黑后不爱出门。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:02bfda85-efe3-4ebe-9fe1-2de8a0473ba3", "text": "我太太很容易就会着凉。", "shortMeaning": "我太太很容易着凉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d47f3af5-4025-49fd-878e-134ccf91fb43", "text": "我太愚蠢了...我竟然试着给你解释我自己都不懂的东西。", "shortMeaning": "我太蠢了，竟试着给你解释自己都不懂的东西。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:985014b7-c855-4711-bb74-1b935fb713b6", "text": "我太累了，做不了功课。", "shortMeaning": "我太累，做不了功课。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9c3b0f86-29c3-4f3a-992f-1549824b1f3c", "text": "我失去了生命中的十五秒。", "shortMeaning": "我浪费了人生的十五秒。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2013d618-b361-4616-bcd1-bfdbcbf0c0d7", "text": "我头撞到了门，肿了一块。", "shortMeaning": "我头撞到门，肿了一块。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d3b5f79f-755e-4b99-8ec5-23acb9da8f61", "text": "我头痛。可能我该吃阿司匹林。", "shortMeaning": "我头痛，也许该吃阿司匹林。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:af408c3e-950e-49db-9397-45bcba428ccd", "text": "我头痛吃了两片阿司匹林。", "shortMeaning": "我头痛，吃了两片阿司匹林。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fff31467-4978-48fb-a599-047b2dfc55bf", "text": "我奇怪他们为什么在表里把我的名字落下了。", "shortMeaning": "我奇怪他们为什么在名单里漏了我的名字。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:52bb3d11-4a52-4a09-bccc-194de2333eb6", "text": "我奶奶说，良好健康的关键是保持积极。", "shortMeaning": "我奶奶说，健康的关键是保持积极。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0f2889d8-d1ba-4c8c-80ff-14dec4b6faaf", "text": "我好不容易找到了你们的房子。", "shortMeaning": "我好不容易才找到你们的房子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:03b569ff-6db8-46b3-8ab7-b635a9276ea9", "text": "我好久没坐帆船了。", "shortMeaning": "我很久没坐帆船了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f50c9625-6fca-49cf-98f1-062ca3804518", "text": "我好久没有睡到这么晚了。", "shortMeaning": "我好久没睡到这么晚了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c662cfa1-2cbd-4b4c-abe8-2d41d8de5ad6", "text": "我好久没见到她了。", "shortMeaning": "我很久没见她了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7e9f7542-7f4e-4b95-9199-36ed46e0187b", "text": "我好像丢了我的钥匙。", "shortMeaning": "我好像丢了钥匙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6efe8587-f0aa-481e-89c5-197f4e33063a", "text": "我好像丢了我的钱包。", "shortMeaning": "我好像丢了钱包。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:51a8474f-a5ba-4fca-b22b-847f0f935b2c", "text": "我好像已经看过你的车。", "shortMeaning": "我好像见过你的车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cdbe78d0-4745-41c3-a5b9-10bb071a91f5", "text": "我好像忘把热水袋拿回来了。", "shortMeaning": "我好像忘了把热水袋拿回来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:375de29e-3bc8-495b-b509-a420b3190383", "text": "我好声好气地问他，他却没有回答。", "shortMeaning": "我客气地问他，他却不回答。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5430a131-89a3-4ddf-8b2a-add3259f139b", "text": "我好多天没吃东西了。", "shortMeaning": "我好几天没吃东西了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1e40a48e-90a5-4e0a-b782-606adc1c8b1d", "text": "我好奇耳垂有什么作用。", "shortMeaning": "我好奇耳垂有什么用。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7bc4ea1c-2ac3-49f5-bc5f-e41fdde5553c", "text": "我好心好意的管待他们，他们也不见得就这样对我。", "shortMeaning": "我好心招待他们，他们却未必这样对我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9d78207c-178f-4fb7-9b3b-453552709237", "text": "我好想吃提拉米苏。", "shortMeaning": "我特别想吃提拉米苏。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f9544fbf-70cb-4d62-860a-e38103ce6fb3", "text": "我好累，我待会必须睡会觉了。", "shortMeaning": "我好累，待会儿必须睡一觉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:11269eb6-ce4b-4fb5-b91f-7392161b0c0f", "text": "我好饿，什么时候可以去吃中饭？", "shortMeaning": "我好饿，什么时候能吃午饭？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8ee5946d-29d4-4f36-92f4-6cf635a65749", "text": "我好，你更好，她最好。", "shortMeaning": "我不错，你更棒，她最出色。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2efc2cda-3dab-4024-a002-dece31f7b245", "text": "我如果发现一幅画失窃了，我会立即关闭博物馆。", "shortMeaning": "如果发现画失窃，我会立即关闭博物馆。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:59dc4122-24d8-4efe-a87a-23be707ee79c", "text": "我如果要上高架，哪个路口离这儿最近？", "shortMeaning": "要上高架的话，哪个路口离这儿最近？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:584c02e4-ef39-43b3-b325-7124d480bed3", "text": "我妈告诉我要是自慰我就会瞎。", "shortMeaning": "我妈说要是自慰我就会瞎。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:76338b9d-9741-4b87-9d58-bbbef3da8548", "text": "我妈在的时候别讨论这件事。", "shortMeaning": "我妈在的时候别谈这件事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6e33cc50-f1e9-42c5-89c9-b3d913fb3455", "text": "我妈妈为所有事情担心。", "shortMeaning": "我妈妈什么事都操心。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:19dc3c1f-05ba-482f-ab50-18ee5a645e72", "text": "我妈妈什么都担心。", "shortMeaning": "我妈妈什么都操心。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3967170a-b0a6-4c93-a284-4fd9f0dd4e61", "text": "我妈妈十分钟前就出门了。", "shortMeaning": "妈妈十分钟前就出门了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2347c698-2e5c-410b-b579-bf3a13ff83e7", "text": "我妈年轻的时候非常漂亮。", "shortMeaning": "我妈年轻时非常漂亮。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dafb2b48-d9a2-4a7b-b75b-f9672da02770", "text": "我妹妹21岁，是个大学生。", "shortMeaning": "我妹妹二十一岁，是大学生。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7880e943-dd98-4dbe-aa85-97510334eea6", "text": "我妹妹二十岁。她是大学生。", "shortMeaning": "我妹妹二十岁，是大学生。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:796d3aa1-7976-4698-b15e-3ac472b47d9e", "text": "我妹妹嫁给了一个医生。", "shortMeaning": "我妹妹嫁给了医生。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1bfe03c1-dcde-4e59-b06d-25052facb27f", "text": "我妹妹没有说“你好”。", "shortMeaning": "我妹妹没打招呼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5e7fda13-ec82-4f95-88a5-afc780b84a04", "text": "我妹妹目前不学习。", "shortMeaning": "我妹妹现在不学习。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3a162a52-c637-4701-816b-13f196df0fe8", "text": "我始终不能理解看足球的乐趣，呵呵。", "shortMeaning": "我始终不懂看足球的乐趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6983b102-e31a-4b94-8d95-2c47431b6b8d", "text": "我始终对你毫无保留。", "shortMeaning": "我对你始终毫无保留。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d727647b-f07c-4e56-8463-6af1d219aff0", "text": "我姐妹在派对上唱了一首英文歌。", "shortMeaning": "我姐妹在派对上唱了首英文歌。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d3667c72-5043-426d-aba5-dc2f8da39047", "text": "我姐妹是一个很棒的打字员。", "shortMeaning": "我姐妹打字很棒。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f3bd9978-6482-45c7-91ab-eec2ceccff74", "text": "我姐妹有一个漂亮的钢琴。", "shortMeaning": "我姐妹有一架漂亮的钢琴。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9c89a8b3-1026-43dd-b17c-db8f49f99005", "text": "我姥姥只喝了点儿汤。", "shortMeaning": "我姥姥只喝了点汤。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5382d825-b2d3-4c50-b5e0-215c24018386", "text": "我姥爷的听力不太好。", "shortMeaning": "我姥爷听力不太好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:61f627f1-8e83-4557-bc10-5fc776e725cb", "text": "我孤单的时候总会想起他。", "shortMeaning": "我孤单时总会想起他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9bce92b2-b45e-474f-995e-95e2536f3844", "text": "我学习了两个多小时，然后就去睡觉了。", "shortMeaning": "我学了两个多小时后去睡觉了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cc5f56b8-b440-4067-b851-8eb482b51c6d", "text": "我学会了不靠她生活。", "shortMeaning": "我学会不依赖她生活。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d3dbae38-d10a-4c5a-a7a2-b3e65fa6f8ee", "text": "我学法语代替德语。", "shortMeaning": "我不学德语改学法语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0ff0ffed-a00e-485e-acf0-1e85ac89e8ec", "text": "我学英语学了4年了。", "shortMeaning": "我学英语四年了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d07f9ea6-4db9-4bab-95f1-39bbeb5f6a91", "text": "我宁愿叫一杯啤酒。", "shortMeaning": "我宁愿点一杯啤酒。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:98d5105c-691a-4d87-9c7b-9cee78c2c1dd", "text": "我宁愿吃药，也不打针。", "shortMeaning": "我宁愿吃药也不打针。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:837dfffd-d692-4e29-a573-e443dfe454ba", "text": "我宁愿呆在家里也不要在这种天气中出门。", "shortMeaning": "我宁愿待在家也不在这种天气出门。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f454b5f8-48f0-4ce6-b89e-47a4e2d7c6e9", "text": "我宁愿您休一天假。", "shortMeaning": "我宁可您休一天假。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e0f07e85-9780-4b15-ab74-8af59aba70fb", "text": "我宁愿没有钱也要找到爱情。", "shortMeaning": "我宁愿没钱也要找到爱情。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a8ddc859-46ea-47df-87b4-8526e5a1e2b3", "text": "我宁愿跟罪人笑也不愿跟圣人哭。", "shortMeaning": "我宁愿跟罪人笑，也不跟圣人哭。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:81a8ac8b-08f3-4e9a-b63d-a40f41d73411", "text": "我宁愿逃学也要玩电子游戏。", "shortMeaning": "我宁愿逃学也要打游戏。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:993dd131-ca5f-46a7-a4dd-cd7409ac18e4", "text": "我宁愿避免这种事。", "shortMeaning": "我宁可避开这种事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0243eeac-a382-4a95-a85f-c692e38b4bb4", "text": "我宁愿饿着也不吃这个。", "shortMeaning": "我宁可挨饿也不吃这个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a1c5ce4a-fb33-4517-937f-997997661624", "text": "我完全不是科学家。", "shortMeaning": "我根本不是科学家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2328802b-8450-4193-b04c-827af67de8b7", "text": "我完全不知道他去哪里了。", "shortMeaning": "我完全不知道他去哪儿了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c46e6716-8447-4142-a8e5-cfbc1254097c", "text": "我完全不认识那个女人。", "shortMeaning": "那个女人我完全不认识。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7f43f86f-c6ca-481c-9a74-1aa24b47b201", "text": "我完全不负任何责任。", "shortMeaning": "我完全不担任何责任。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:626d3faa-7726-4241-add8-5f7464d6ff99", "text": "我完全不赞成你的意见。", "shortMeaning": "你的意见我完全不赞同。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fd92dc63-f891-4da7-b5c5-e9b20e8ea248", "text": "我完全无法想象自己会离婚。", "shortMeaning": "我无法想象自己会离婚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3ef110ec-6022-40f5-92d6-0d689e91ab12", "text": "我完全是在偶然的情况下发现了密室。", "shortMeaning": "我完全是在偶然中发现的密室。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f174eb89-2c7c-43df-8d43-5f79db0cfab3", "text": "我完全理解你得处境。", "shortMeaning": "我完全理解你的处境。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b0f798c1-5790-4c7e-9a42-0d82b9db4a0c", "text": "我完全相信你是清白的。", "shortMeaning": "我完全相信你清白无辜。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:64f8b02f-e20c-4c63-bcce-51e24451691e", "text": "我完全相信我们的爱情。", "shortMeaning": "我完全相信我们的感情。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:38650e86-704a-4775-b4cc-c9990eab9a06", "text": "我完全看不懂爱因斯坦的相对性理论。", "shortMeaning": "我完全看不懂爱因斯坦的相对论。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c40d236-c87d-4b05-b7f8-f6c63664f23e", "text": "我完全赞成你的观点。", "shortMeaning": "我完全赞同你的观点。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6a50604f-aa5f-4154-8cff-38be5513e1b0", "text": "我实在不擅长这个。", "shortMeaning": "这个我实在不擅长。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:33d76034-0b32-4d65-b9c0-8cbf2ae4c4df", "text": "我实在想不通这事是怎么发生的。", "shortMeaning": "我实在想不通事情怎么会这样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:55bda4dc-0169-4f34-ad6c-60db181a466b", "text": "我害羞得不敢正面看她的脸。", "shortMeaning": "我害羞得不敢正眼看她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a1df1fa8-e27c-448e-a524-c56ea7ec7769", "text": "我家乡的民风非常淳朴。", "shortMeaning": "我家乡的民风很淳朴。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:58bd29c4-d9ec-4e8e-9c37-36e609c0cb67", "text": "我家前面有个小庭院。", "shortMeaning": "我家前面有个小院子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dff2ed5e-cdea-4e05-a9af-45cc1a9692a1", "text": "我家后院有个小水池。", "shortMeaning": "我家后院有座小水池。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6ca7d76c-3518-4dca-9b97-c9f61b9c323d", "text": "我家后面曾经有棵大樱桃树。", "shortMeaning": "我家后面曾有一棵大樱桃树。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5e6bec37-c6e0-43ff-a660-5625b74f097c", "text": "我家后面那些牛只吃郁金香。", "shortMeaning": "我家后面的牛只吃郁金香。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:11ed171b-a29c-4181-b9b7-dd3b076e02ea", "text": "我家和邻居家以院子之间的篱笆为分界线。", "shortMeaning": "我家和邻居家以院子间的篱笆为界。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:93d6fe14-31fe-47a9-81c7-7ef7f91fed33", "text": "我家在十八层，主卧和客厅都面朝南方。", "shortMeaning": "我家在十八层，主卧和客厅都朝南。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:97e689bd-a435-490a-b61b-485f3d8bfbd9", "text": "我家在这座桥的另一头。", "shortMeaning": "我家在桥的另一边。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c34278fa-60ce-4a91-9d51-e7070f9c0587", "text": "我家孩子不怎么出门。", "shortMeaning": "我家孩子不太出门。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c54e198c-20f9-4923-abaa-f3b3665c193f", "text": "我家宝宝还不会说话。", "shortMeaning": "我家宝宝还不会讲话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6eb04ab2-30f0-42f0-880c-e3836fb34f1b", "text": "我家的猫不怕人，不怕虫子，就怕小鸡。", "shortMeaning": "我家的猫不怕人也不怕虫，就怕小鸡。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:af0a68c9-b6f0-4179-92f2-6fedc006fb67", "text": "我家的猫被小鸡啄到鼻子后，见到小鸡就绕着走，连自己的猫粮被吃了都不敢吱一声。", "shortMeaning": "我家猫被小鸡啄了鼻子后，见鸡就躲，猫粮被吃也不敢吱声。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e7e28f54-45b6-49e3-a559-3a2c2263eb63", "text": "我家离这里五个街区远。", "shortMeaning": "我家离这里五个街区。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0326c9c0-f525-45d7-afcd-126da10dbf93", "text": "我家里有个老年人突然倒在地上，大概是中风了。", "shortMeaning": "家里有位老人突然倒地，大概中风了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f3ba6033-ed5c-4e4b-974a-9704fcec30b1", "text": "我家附近有一座教堂。", "shortMeaning": "我家附近有座教堂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8ddd80a4-3006-4647-a6da-2e6823f27974", "text": "我家附近有个漂亮的公园。", "shortMeaning": "我家附近有个漂亮公园。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:72935a3a-bf1c-41a1-ae4e-cdba7bf1b91a", "text": "我家院子里种着很多竹子。", "shortMeaning": "我家院子里种了很多竹子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a85c015f-d987-44fc-9606-c533e7613391", "text": "我寄给她一个娃娃。", "shortMeaning": "我寄了个娃娃给她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:061608e6-547b-4ae4-83a3-0b2f93b57120", "text": "我对中国宗教感兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "我对中国宗教很有兴趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7c0caccf-69e3-4146-879a-55e63317277a", "text": "我对书法略知一二。", "shortMeaning": "我对书法略懂一点。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:68df552d-f3cd-41a6-9a58-d5d5317a7768", "text": "我对于上大学有一种渴望。", "shortMeaning": "我渴望上大学。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:89cf7c6f-ed85-42c8-8bcb-13602fa0eed1", "text": "我对亚洲的历史很感兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "我对亚洲历史很感兴趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:35d407b9-5cd0-4f56-8eca-2ee806614a85", "text": "我对人造语言不是很感兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "我对人造语言不太感兴趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3262ef26-fb10-419c-a659-1987c8f31e97", "text": "我对他们无耻的行径感到厌恶。", "shortMeaning": "他们无耻的行径令我厌恶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6bbec7db-6324-4fb3-998e-86cfc3b92ba4", "text": "我对他的事情了如指掌。", "shortMeaning": "他的事我了如指掌。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1c9fc941-1b3f-4e9f-b722-061c0e80acc8", "text": "我对他的坚持感到很惊讶。", "shortMeaning": "我对他的坚持感到惊讶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6eca4c4c-3bfb-46c9-8a00-6da5bec5a17b", "text": "我对他的态度变了。", "shortMeaning": "我对他的态度改变了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:181fabed-e6e3-4d7c-8341-1bf75f9d75ac", "text": "我对他的爱已经淡去了。", "shortMeaning": "我对他的爱已经淡了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0a5787b8-8d25-49be-b568-3b6a239339b6", "text": "我对他英语的快速进步感到吃惊。", "shortMeaning": "我对他英语进步之快感到吃惊。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:52216de8-f1df-41d5-b3f6-b03a60ddde64", "text": "我对你不负责任的态度感到惊讶。", "shortMeaning": "你不负责的态度令我惊讶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2ed388da-86e1-40ee-9369-b050abd6f60e", "text": "我对你刮目相看了。", "shortMeaning": "我对你刮目相看。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0f526de4-8094-43bc-9392-33f7ca9de93b", "text": "我对你的厚颜无耻感到惊讶。", "shortMeaning": "你的厚颜无耻令我惊讶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:35d353f0-5713-4448-95a5-650ed8645e2d", "text": "我对你的大胆感到很惊讶。", "shortMeaning": "我对你的大胆感到惊讶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:08c680c6-2d52-44ba-98b2-152d007273f7", "text": "我对你的评价降低了。", "shortMeaning": "我对你的评价下降了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:871aec5a-367b-4292-afc0-88a7c7ce84a0", "text": "我对别人都不好，因为你发指示叫我来谈谈话的啊。", "shortMeaning": "我对别人都不好，因为你指示我来谈话啊。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bcbf2f7f-093d-47c9-bf71-4e75952909f1", "text": "我对国际象棋不感兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "我对国际象棋没兴趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:63604f44-6cee-4251-b6da-d7dce2f9aa55", "text": "我对外籍员工没有偏见。", "shortMeaning": "我对外籍员工没偏见。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9a21f01b-d975-4213-8b67-ad71564f911e", "text": "我对她一见钟情了。", "shortMeaning": "我对她一见钟情。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6e88d908-34cc-412c-a775-6ec50739ee2c", "text": "我对她不是很熟悉。", "shortMeaning": "我对她不太熟悉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:38ff6bab-07aa-48e8-948e-add8c69b8d98", "text": "我对她有很深刻的印象。", "shortMeaning": "她给我留下很深印象。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1e50169a-61c0-4494-83d1-7d0e2c3cfc61", "text": "我对她的大公无私怀有敬意。", "shortMeaning": "我敬佩她的大公无私。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:20cb3f8a-125f-4da9-bd29-3785b2e10af8", "text": "我对她隐瞒了真实的数额。", "shortMeaning": "我向她隐瞒了真实的数额。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:95b4b90a-20d5-4522-b3e1-78030ac539ab", "text": "我对我的人生很满意。", "shortMeaning": "我对自己的人生很满意。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:809496d5-54d9-4187-966e-701e39100550", "text": "我对我的生活相当满意。", "shortMeaning": "我对自己的生活相当满意。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2cf93fac-97c6-45fe-ab0d-e889518ddfee", "text": "我对我自己感到惭愧。", "shortMeaning": "我对自己感到惭愧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b564530b-355b-446c-bad3-1b9ae29ef27b", "text": "我对掌上阅读很感兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "我对移动阅读很有兴趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:00604533-4d60-451b-a07a-71c0a760b377", "text": "我对方言很感兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "我对方言很有兴趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:598133e8-020e-4389-bea9-b628981183b3", "text": "我对日本一无所知。", "shortMeaning": "我对日本毫不了解。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9203e567-9080-4bb2-817b-122345ce9c7e", "text": "我对昨天晚上发生的事情感到非常的抱歉。", "shortMeaning": "我对昨晚发生的事感到非常抱歉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fdb2b333-ef20-4a31-a418-4f6cba97cd8e", "text": "我对欧洲历史很熟悉。", "shortMeaning": "我熟悉欧洲历史。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a4d94638-c5d4-46be-a3a3-fefd8d3bb579", "text": "我对消息感到十分惊讶。", "shortMeaning": "我对这个消息十分惊讶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b5af7a69-ca4d-41b0-b30b-3baafb738505", "text": "我对游泳很感兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "我对游泳很有兴趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d06a7c6d-414e-4895-b57b-ee91d613ebb2", "text": "我对现代艺术不感兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "我对现代艺术没兴趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aa5b3b3c-e0bb-45cb-8271-30b70efc46e4", "text": "我对祖母的记忆很模糊。", "shortMeaning": "我对祖母的印象很模糊。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a9395f7f-c37a-4741-8db2-3c49b731c408", "text": "我对纽约了如指掌。", "shortMeaning": "纽约我熟得很。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d2c369e1-a480-4faa-a76a-6f17db04a16b", "text": "我对细节不感兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "我对细节没兴趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:376bf620-a86f-4d38-8846-43b9af6fcdc0", "text": "我对自己发誓今后不会再那么做。", "shortMeaning": "我对自己发誓今后不再那么做。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2725f329-01b5-414a-a39d-b461cdb1abc7", "text": "我对自己的未来想了很多。", "shortMeaning": "我为自己的未来想了许多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:12aba8d5-e1e2-4cc8-9e75-63b9e0ec25af", "text": "我对自己的行为感到羞愧。", "shortMeaning": "我为自己的行为羞愧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:942e61ab-ea38-4960-ac6b-659a0ad1122a", "text": "我对语言很感兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "我对语言很有兴趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4b996077-9b36-4baa-8698-f13822a203d3", "text": "我对足球很感兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "我对足球很有兴趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:709e5e20-328d-4136-9b64-4053a51534a0", "text": "我对运动不感兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "我对运动没兴趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4fb13b1c-1f28-42c5-85c9-f70c39f8f9c8", "text": "我对这个世界来说太老了。", "shortMeaning": "对这世界而言我太老了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6c2d6f19-5ff4-4ebe-9d30-c491304845cc", "text": "我对这个单词不熟。", "shortMeaning": "这个单词我不熟。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:39e008cc-ab1b-41ab-adc2-37a39925097e", "text": "我对这个始料不及的消息感到很惊讶。", "shortMeaning": "我对这个始料不及的消息很惊讶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9ec4a77f-c0ca-4ca8-8e43-eee48e2a46dc", "text": "我对这个政府的印象是，他们需要强一点儿的经济政策，要不然将来会遇到很大的问题。", "shortMeaning": "我觉得这届政府需要更强的经济政策，否则将来会遇到大问题。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c430551a-daa8-448f-bdc6-b00ce89aa238", "text": "我对这个计划一无所知。", "shortMeaning": "这个计划我一无所知。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5bf26f7f-593b-4236-8ff9-404023377614", "text": "我对这些故事很感兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "我对这些故事很有兴趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4dfef67d-f618-4738-a026-b868045b5790", "text": "我对这些都没有印象。", "shortMeaning": "这些我都没有印象。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:00eeae82-4a93-4e59-b2e5-0305569752d0", "text": "我对这本书感兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "我对这本书很有兴趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7ba28e91-56ba-4a4b-8ac7-4d68bf1a7584", "text": "我对这段旋律上头了。", "shortMeaning": "我迷上了这段旋律。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9a907007-69c6-4d4a-ae22-746097d9b318", "text": "我对这气候习惯了。", "shortMeaning": "我适应了这气候。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:befd4588-261e-473f-b2f9-b44a421bcbe2", "text": "我对这种愚蠢的行为表示非常的气愤。", "shortMeaning": "我对这种愚蠢行为非常气愤。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8a45a171-e014-4f7e-bdef-dd55e191298c", "text": "我对那个术语不熟悉。", "shortMeaning": "那个术语我不熟。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ab8a6130-db86-4e0a-8f15-c5af2f2435fc", "text": "我对那么大的数没有概念。", "shortMeaning": "那么大的数我毫无概念。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f501351e-78d9-4fc4-a4f3-519f9ae266bf", "text": "我对那位女士印象不深。", "shortMeaning": "那位女士没给我留下很深印象。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:883c5a23-b6d8-4be1-a24b-235aa46c9666", "text": "我对那天的印象很深刻。", "shortMeaning": "我对那天印象很深。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f795e105-465c-40dc-b154-a0f1895d15c3", "text": "我对钓鱼很感兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "我对钓鱼很有兴趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bc7f6713-8e23-485d-b980-faa157aecef6", "text": "我对音乐一无所知。", "shortMeaning": "我对音乐毫不了解。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:648f4adf-594e-43a7-9270-8702e0461496", "text": "我对音乐非常感兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "我对音乐兴趣浓厚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b19b4138-3c41-41c6-a3ab-8e25c4e679c8", "text": "我将会努力作贡献的！", "shortMeaning": "我会努力作贡献的！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:07b4fceb-36fe-4aff-9712-e0540b25ccc1", "text": "我将会在五月23号到达。", "shortMeaning": "我将在五月二十三号到达。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8acf67cb-6532-4f10-bce7-ff08bf02e996", "text": "我将在五点钟到那里。", "shortMeaning": "我五点钟到那里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:85a3ccb0-f756-4c8c-b09f-08203e06c804", "text": "我将增加画龙点睛的功能。", "shortMeaning": "我会加上画龙点睛的功能。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cb8984c0-ba74-40ac-a056-34636083e85e", "text": "我将水倒入了桶中。", "shortMeaning": "我把水倒进了桶里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:25d88964-78f6-4850-aa75-1dda5e964370", "text": "我将确保你们在第一年后有一个增长。", "shortMeaning": "我将确保你们第一年后有所增长。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8e807993-ce2e-4f55-8636-efe7977e65a2", "text": "我将要写德语句子。", "shortMeaning": "我要写德语句子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:71c1ad87-2206-4bff-a13c-995b0448a580", "text": "我将要飞到波士顿去。", "shortMeaning": "我要飞到波士顿去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:134d89fa-97df-4964-a1cc-f6b88d619d50", "text": "我尊重他这位作家，也尊重他这个人。", "shortMeaning": "我既尊重他这位作家，也尊重他这个人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cf3fba6e-6911-46ac-9f7d-83d860cb66ec", "text": "我小个便，带好围巾，就可以走了。", "shortMeaning": "我小便一下，带上围巾就可以走了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4381ea02-d26e-40fe-b94b-2be3f5f13fd3", "text": "我小的时候从没想过自己会出名。", "shortMeaning": "我小时候从没想过自己会出名。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cdafb650-fc76-440d-bd48-b42a41cffcb8", "text": "我小的时候经常跟我父亲一起去钓鱼的。", "shortMeaning": "我小时候常跟父亲一起去钓鱼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e7bf3626-96e7-4819-952f-d8bbe30ae0fc", "text": "我小睡后就感到生龙活虎。", "shortMeaning": "我小睡后就觉得精神抖擞。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:65634ee9-ce3c-48cc-a209-e83c43e9afd9", "text": "我小睡后就感到精力充沛。", "shortMeaning": "我小睡后就觉得精力充沛。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:41bf861a-d80a-4c74-a278-1eec38769d20", "text": "我少不了这本字典。", "shortMeaning": "这本字典我少不了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b43e6fce-c088-416c-a126-d0b76aed5f32", "text": "我就住在愚园路1136弄2号。", "shortMeaning": "我住在愚园路1136弄2号。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:09d22c4f-9299-4b32-9dea-abdfd307639a", "text": "我就只告诉你，他是个大胃王。", "shortMeaning": "我只告诉你，他是个大胃王。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e9f357fa-a133-4800-a702-d1f5a83cdef9", "text": "我就只告诉你，他靠不住。", "shortMeaning": "我只告诉你，他靠不住。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ed5e7c00-3bf1-4a14-94ad-84d4e7d682d5", "text": "我就开门见山的说了。", "shortMeaning": "我就开门见山地说了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ad0b9f9b-2bd4-45ad-ba08-a84f2fe1707b", "text": "我就是不道歉，你奈我何？", "shortMeaning": "我就是不道歉，你能拿我怎样？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3eee6518-89d6-41d8-ab98-5c7cb63f30f4", "text": "我就是你要找的人。", "shortMeaning": "你要找的人就是我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:32ba3a5c-957d-4343-a022-5a19a348e963", "text": "我就是在这得到它的。", "shortMeaning": "我就是在这里得到它的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:60b18457-dff3-4477-9bd5-f0d9a2082339", "text": "我就是想让你看看这个。", "shortMeaning": "我就是想给你看看这个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:82ddaeed-2656-4497-9d6d-428a3a821492", "text": "我就是迈不过这道坎。", "shortMeaning": "我就是过不去这个坎。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:02210f28-f4ff-4594-9d4a-f92795b8ba18", "text": "我就是这么学会英语的。", "shortMeaning": "我就是这样学会英语的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:421e20b6-5a12-4f21-bde6-e794688fa913", "text": "我就爱欺负不懂中文的人。", "shortMeaning": "我就爱欺负不懂中文的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:42cac967-7410-46fd-b518-837571040614", "text": "我就知道你会这么说。", "shortMeaning": "我早知道你会这么说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:00836139-cc63-42ad-9c69-a02a92332f2f", "text": "我就装作不知道好了。", "shortMeaning": "我就装不知道算了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cd87e98f-d452-4d2d-a083-86ebe1d10c68", "text": "我就要成为百万富翁了。", "shortMeaning": "我快成百万富翁了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d803a1f4-8e79-462e-91f7-af6c4a550b4a", "text": "我就要读完这本书了。", "shortMeaning": "我快读完这本书了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fe3acaa6-aa16-4265-b83f-ad82db5fb944", "text": "我就说，他早晚有一天会跟你分手吧。", "shortMeaning": "我就说嘛，他早晚会跟你分手。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a6f9368d-eec7-4d5e-8d8a-42e0e4169ae1", "text": "我尽可能快地需要那个。", "shortMeaning": "我需要那个，越快越好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
